s/class_os.html#class-os-method-get-version-alias\r\n\r\n> Note: This method is only supported on Windows and macOS. On other operating systems, it returns the same value as [get_version()](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/4.4/classes/class_os.html#class-os-method-get-version).\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2912555114/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2922516849","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106859#issuecomment-2922516849","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106859","id":2922516849,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uMhFx","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-30T14:13:47Z","updated_at":"2025-05-30T14:13:47Z","body":"> Should this method also return android version codename?\r\n\r\nAndroid versions since 10 don't have \"marketing\" codenames anymore, so I